{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20952","headline":"夜饮朝眠曲 · 李贺","name":"夜饮朝眠曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"觞酣出座东方高，腰横半解星劳劳。\n柳苑鸦啼公主醉，薄露压花蕙园气。\n玉转湿丝牵晓水，熟粉生香琅玕紫。\n夜饮朝眠断无事，楚罗之帏卧皇子。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20952.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20952","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}